{
  "description": "Syllogism Venn tester — the learner shades regions and drops ✕ marks on a three-circle diagram for each premise of a categorical syllogism (All M are P, Some S are M), then tests whether the shaded diagram makes the conclusion valid. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
